WEBVTT

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:01.400
Does the AI help with this

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.000
part at all?

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:03.980
The built -in ontology agent can

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.240
assist here. It can inspect supported

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.160
workspace sources, look at the column

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.100
names, sample a few rows of

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.980
actual data, and propose a draft

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:13.020
model with descriptions.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.100
You can even upload an existing

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.900
corporate data dictionary as grounding

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.100
context for the agent.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.160
But again, a human has to

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.960
check it. A human domain expert

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.320
must meticulously review those proposals.
